<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Tanahorn — Tanahorn normal offering-site viewpoint return [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>Follow the normal marked walking route to the Tanahorn Sami offering-site viewpoint and return along the same route. Remain well back from unprotected cliff edges. The descriptive route covers about 7.26 km return. Distance, climbing and duration figures are approximate planning estimates. Wind, fog, cold weather and slippery rock can make the exposed destination unsafe. Respect the offering site: do not move stones or build new cairns. Check current local information and obey temporary closures; a marked source record does not guarantee the path is open today.

Route derived from ©Kartverket Tur- og friluftsruter / Turrutebasen Fotrute under CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Changes: source coordinates transformed to WGS84; walking course ordered and retraced for the return. No elevation assigned. Descriptive planning geometry, not navigation-grade. Recorded normal-route maintenance: Finnmark Friluftsråd and local voluntary associations, as named in the 2023 source records.

Route geometry: © Kartverket — https://www.kartverket.no/; TurOgFriluftsruter / Nasjonal database for turruter. Identify contributing maintainer, source, licence and coordinate transformation/retrace changes per route. — Kartverket Turrutebasen released TurOgFriluftsruter walking features. Licence: CC-BY-4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Source: https://www.geonorge.no/geonetwork/srv/api/records/d1422d17-6d95-4ef1-96ab-8af31744dd63/formatters/xml. Dataset: https://www.kartverket.no/geodataarbeid/det-offentlige-kartgrunnlaget-dok/turruter.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="70.86013663093047" lon="28.915746427612277"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86026864544995" lon="28.915783746916606"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86038110578491" lon="28.915760403770392"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86042357805088" lon="28.915730319951823"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86052864212952" lon="28.915338820160336"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86069259702744" lon="28.9146311963982"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86075729608791" lon="28.914395192666674"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86084211239874" lon="28.914061605780738"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86093156171805" lon="28.91354911076998"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86098171373109" lon="28.913314435559307"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86101350233626" lon="28.913224536567412"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86106262149882" lon="28.913176220960388"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86113360867013" lon="28.913190430624446"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86121844899071" lon="28.913183553654317"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86127270423879" lon="28.913245640529485"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86133341712767" lon="28.91328182848076"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.8613975006561" lon="28.913356344511154"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86143906198522" lon="28.91344017758139"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86147086375226" lon="28.91349627808705"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86155646119201" lon="28.9134249504917"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86163084932019" lon="28.91334461510528"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.86170472660123" lon="28.913192322733387"></trkpt><trkpt lat="70.8617463314